---
import Section from "@/layouts/Section.astro";
import Animation from "./Animation.astro";
---

<Section layout="split" eyebrow="Real Time" sectionEyebrow="Architecture">
  <Fragment slot="title">
    Serverless architecture, <br />from the ground up: <br />Isolates <span
      class="text-text-subtle">vs.</span
    >
    <span class="text-orange-900">Containers</span>
  </Fragment>

  <Fragment slot="description">
    Workers are built on unique architecture called isolates.
    <br /><br />
    Isolates are an order of magnitude more lightweight, which means they can easily
    and quickly scale up and down to meet your needs.
  </Fragment>

  <Fragment slot="info">
    <span class="contents text-label-x-small">Isolates</span> are an order of magnitude
    lighter than containers, <br />
    enabling faster startup, higher density, lower costs, and instant scale.
  </Fragment>

  <Animation />
</Section>
